  "goodToKnow": "Die Wiederherstellung is restoration or recovery: die Wiederherstellung der Gesundheit, die Wiederherstellung der Ordnung, and on computers die Systemwiederherstellung (system restore). Wiederherstellen means to restore: Die Frauenkirche in Dresden, destroyed in 1945, was wiederhergestellt and reopened in 2005, a symbol of reconciliation. It's built from wieder (again), her (back here) and stellen (to put)."
